SHOW keyword [/OUTPUT=file]

  SHOW DEFAULT    the current folder
  SHOW USERS      who is logged in
  SHOW SYSTEM     the system name, version, uptime and card
  SHOW TIME       the date and time, or the uptime with no clock chip
  SHOW DEVICES    the devices and their states; SHOW DEVICES DOOR1 for one
  SHOW TERMINAL   the screen size and colors
  SHOW MEMORY     the memory in use and free

/OUTPUT=file writes the text to a file instead of the screen.
